WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to the CleanCut demo.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Pick a rating in the toolbar popup.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The red section is a tagged violent scene.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Tags come from the community catalog.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Watch the clock jump when we reach it.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.600
Here it comes.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
[swords clashing]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.500
The fight goes on for ten seconds.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
And we are back.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Nothing here is tagged by a person.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Quiet for a moment.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Something else is coming up.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.500
[woman moaning]

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
[bed creaking]

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.500
[both moaning]

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
That scene was never tagged by a person.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Next, some language.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
What the fuck was that?

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.500
Listen closely.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
The audio should have gone quiet.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.500
One more tagged scene ahead.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.500
Gore skipped, if your rating says so.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.000
That's the end of the demo.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Thanks for watching.
